{"id":"af5c01a198d6e923","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-stone-type-space.md","title":"Compact Zero-Dimensional Stone Type Space","display":"thm-stone-type-space — Compact Zero-Dimensional Stone Type Space","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-stone-type-space","aliases":["17-thm-stone-type-space"],"display":"thm-stone-type-space — Compact Zero-Dimensional Stone Type Space","depends_on":["[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-type]]","[[17-df-stone-topology]]","[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-thm-5.4.3","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-stone-type-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-stone-type-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-stone-type-space — Compact Zero-Dimensional Stone Type Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ad251400f2bb592\" href=\"?note=8ad251400f2bb592\" title=\"17-df-stone-topology\">17-df-stone-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-5.4.3"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。所有集合和拓扑均在同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n(T)\">\\(S_n(T)\\)</span> 上。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n(T)\">\\(S_n(T)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span> (complete types and formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\varphi]_T\">\\([\\varphi]_T\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_n(T)\">\\(\\tau_n(T)\\)</span> (basic clopen sets and Stone topology, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8ad251400f2bb592\" href=\"?note=8ad251400f2bb592\" title=\"17-df-stone-topology\">17-df-stone-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Finite}\">\\(\\operatorname{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\nT\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\\;&amp;\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau_n(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\nS_n(T)\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal U_0\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}(\\mathcal U_0)\n\\land\nS_n(T)\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U_0\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in S_n(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\np\\neq q\n\\to\n\\exists O_p,O_q\\in\\tau_n(T)\\;\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}\n(p\\in O_p\\land q\\in O_q\\land O_p\\cap O_q=\\varnothing)\n\\Bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall p\\in S_n(T)\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_n(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\np\\in O\n\\to\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\n\\bigl(\np\\in[\\varphi]_T\n\\land\n[\\varphi]_T\\subseteq O\n\\land\nS_n(T)\\setminus[\\varphi]_T=[\\neg\\varphi]_T\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\nT\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\\;&amp;\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau_n(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\nS_n(T)\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal U_0\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}(\\mathcal U_0)\n\\land\nS_n(T)\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U_0\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in S_n(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\np\\neq q\n\\to\n\\exists O_p,O_q\\in\\tau_n(T)\\;\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}\n(p\\in O_p\\land q\\in O_q\\land O_p\\cap O_q=\\varnothing)\n\\Bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall p\\in S_n(T)\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_n(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\np\\in O\n\\to\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\n\\bigl(\np\\in[\\varphi]_T\n\\land\n[\\varphi]_T\\subseteq O\n\\land\nS_n(T)\\setminus[\\varphi]_T=[\\neg\\varphi]_T\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The three conjuncts state compactness, Hausdorff separation, and a clopen basis directly. No external closure operator or untyped product-space homeomorphism is required.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-stone-topology","status":"resolved","id":"8ad251400f2bb592","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-stone-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ (theory, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_n(T)$ and $\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ (complete types and formulas, see [[17-df-type]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-stone-topology","status":"resolved","id":"8ad251400f2bb592","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[\\varphi]_T$ and $\\tau_n(T)$ (basic clopen sets and Stone topology, see [[17-df-stone-topology]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Finite}$ (finite-set predicate, see [[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"S_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\varphi]_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\nT\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\\;&\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau_n(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\nS_n(T)\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\n\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal U_0\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}(\\mathcal U_0)\n\\land\nS_n(T)\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U_0\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\\\\n&{}\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in S_n(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\np\\neq q\n\\to\n\\exists O_p,O_q\\in\\tau_n(T)\\;\n\\\\\n&\\hspace{27mm}\n(p\\in O_p\\land q\\in O_q\\land O_p\\cap O_q=\\varnothing)\n\\Bigr)\n\\\\\n&{}\\land\n\\forall p\\in S_n(T)\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_n(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\np\\in O\n\\to\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\\\\n&\\hspace{22mm}\n\\bigl(\np\\in[\\varphi]_T\n\\land\n[\\varphi]_T\\subseteq O\n\\land\nS_n(T)\\setminus[\\varphi]_T=[\\neg\\varphi]_T\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2076,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-pres